<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We see what God is recovering</l><l>What a sight it is to see!</l><l>What a treasure He is building,</l><l>It’s His Body corporately:</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We’re so happy and so thankful</l><l>For this opportunity;</l><l>Thank You, Lord, You’ve been so faithful</l><l>To show all of this to me;</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
